WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.894
Same model eleven

00:00:01.706 --> 00:00:02.873
times the tokens

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.840
Two open-source AI

00:00:04.652 --> 00:00:05.842
code reviewers ran

00:00:05.654 --> 00:00:06.420
on the same

00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:07.069
model and the

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:08.248
same merge requests

00:00:08.378 --> 00:00:09.262
but one used

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:10.206
four to eleven

00:00:10.017 --> 00:00:11.161
times the tokens

00:00:11.686 --> 00:00:12.582
The difference was

00:00:12.394 --> 00:00:13.230
the harness

00:00:13.384 --> 00:00:14.516
one reviewer reads

00:00:14.327 --> 00:00:15.188
the diff once

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.907
and answers

00:00:15.943 --> 00:00:16.685
while the other

00:00:16.497 --> 00:00:17.806
explores the repo

00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:18.749
turn by turn

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:20.547
Every turn re-sends

00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:21.833
the growing conversation

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:22.564
and that is

00:00:22.376 --> 00:00:23.283
where the tokens

00:00:23.095 --> 00:00:23.543
go

00:00:23.814 --> 00:00:24.392
not in the

00:00:24.203 --> 00:00:25.229
model itself

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:26.772
Full story on

00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:27.479
the dashboard
